      "text": "```\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|              DESIGN CRITICISM: THE LANDSCAPE                         |\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                      |\n|  FUNCTIONALIST TRADITION          FORMALIST TRADITION                |\n|  \"Form follows function\"          \"Form is the content\"              |\n|  Sullivan, Bauhaus, Rams          Arts and Crafts, Art Nouveau       |\n|  Design as problem-solving        Design as cultural expression      |\n|                                                                      |\n|  SOCIAL CRITICISM                 MARKET CRITICISM                   |\n|  Papanek: Design for whom?        Vance Packard: The Waste Makers    |\n|  Decolonial design                Planned obsolescence as fraud      |\n|  Universal design                 Fast fashion as extraction         |\n|                                                                      |\n|  SYSTEMS THINKING                 ETHICS & DARK PATTERNS             |\n|  Design as policy (Latour)        UI manipulation (dark patterns)    |\n|  \"Artefacts have politics\"        Attention economy design           |\n|  (Langdon Winner)                 Algorithmic harm                   |\n|                                                                      |\n+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
